<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsubsection"><a href="#A1.SS7.SSS2" title="In A.7 Rigorous Analysis of the MSE Trade-off ‣ Appendix A Appendix ‣ Primary-Fine Decoupling for Action Generation in Robotic Imitation" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">A.7.2 </span>The PF-DAG Trade-Off: <math class="ltx_Math" alttext="V_{\text{inter}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>V</mi><mtext>inter</mtext></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">V_{\text{inter}}</annotation></semantics></math> vs. <math class="ltx_Math" alttext="E_{\text{classify}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>E</mi><mtext>classify</mtext></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">E_{\text{classify}}</annotation></semantics></math></span></a></li>
</ol></li>
